461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 291 0 R
/T (or more labels \(letters, digits, hyphens, not starting or ending with a hyphen\) followed by .com, .edu or .org. Boundary checks make the match all-or-nothing. A negative lookbehind stops a match from starting in the middle of other email characters, and a negative lookahead stops x@site.com.au from being read as x@site.com. As a result root@@bad.com, a@b@c.com and x@-site.com are rejected entirely \(all covered by tests\).)
/E (or more labels \(letters, digits, hyphens, not starting or ending with a hyphen\) followed by .com, .edu or .org. Boundary checks make the match all-or-nothing. A negative lookbehind stops a match from starting in the middle of other email characters, and a negative lookahead stops x@site.com.au from being read as x@site.com. As a result root@@bad.com, a@b@c.com and x@-site.com are rejected entirely \(all covered by tests\).)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
