/T (Recurrence: best\(i, j\) = cell\(i, j\) + max\(best\(up\), best\(left\), best\(diagonal\)\); ways\(i, j\) = the sum of ways over the neighbours that reach that maximum, modulo 109+7. Blocked or unreachable cells have no score and 0 ways.)
/E (Recurrence: best\(i, j\) = cell\(i, j\) + max\(best\(up\), best\(left\), best\(diagonal\)\); ways\(i, j\) = the sum of ways over the neighbours that reach that maximum, modulo 109+7. Blocked or unreachable cells have no score and 0 ways.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [15 17 16]
>>
endobj
3292 0 obj
<<
