/Title (or more labels \(letters, digits, hyphens, not starting or ending with a hyphen\) followed by .com, .edu or .org. Boundary checks make the match all-or-nothing. A negative lookbehind stops a match from starting in the middle of other email characters, and a negative lookahead stops x@site.com.au from being read as x@site.com. As a result root@@bad.com, a@b@c.com and x@-site.com are rejected entirely \(all covered by tests\).)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7010 0 R
/Prev 7198 0 R
/Next 7227 0 R
>>
endobj
