/Title (Regular expressions do the cleaning. Currency markers \(Rs, INR, $, the rupee sign\) and thousands separators are removed and the price is parsed as a Decimal, which must be above 0. The rating is the first number in the text, so 4.8 out of 5 and 4.7/5 both work, and it must lie between 0 and 5. HTML entities such as &amp; are decoded.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7235 0 R
/Prev 7264 0 R
/Next 7278 0 R
>>
endobj
